335
00:16:00,350 --> 00:16:02,350
She's a lot easier to talk to than she looks.

336
00:16:02,350 --> 00:16:03,350
Don't talk to her.

337
00:16:03,350 --> 00:16:04,350
That big appetite's nice, too.

338
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:05,350
Don't look at her!

339
00:16:05,350 --> 00:16:06,350
Hmm?

340
00:16:06,350 --> 00:16:09,350
