342
00:16:13,350 --> 00:16:15,350
Oh, yeah, right!

343
00:16:15,350 --> 00:16:16,350
Cause she's kind of famous and all.

344
00:16:16,350 --> 00:16:17,350
Oh, man!

345
00:16:17,350 --> 00:16:18,350
