351
00:16:25,350 --> 00:16:26,350
Of...

352
00:16:26,350 --> 00:16:27,350
Uh...

353
00:16:27,350 --> 00:16:28,350
What'd you eat?

354
00:16:28,350 --> 00:16:29,350
But you sure had lots of curry one time!

355
00:16:29,350 --> 00:16:30,350
Uh...

356
00:16:30,350 --> 00:16:31,350
Uh...

357
00:16:31,350 --> 00:16:33,350
This isn't about what Kanzaki has.

358
00:16:33,350 --> 00:16:34,350
It's about what I lack.

359
00:16:34,350 --> 00:16:35,350
As a man.

360
00:16:35,350 --> 00:16:36,350
So you mean that, huh?

361
00:16:36,350 --> 00:16:37,350
You have a thing for her.

362
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:38,350
Hilarious, right?

363
00:16:38,350 --> 00:16:39,350
Me and Yamada....

364
00:16:39,350 --> 00:16:40,350
We ended up hearing about you taste pastries, huh?

365
00:16:40,350 --> 00:16:41,350
You ended up hearing about her pastries.

366
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:42,350
I'm not cut out for her.

367
00:16:42,350 --> 00:16:43,350
You really think that?

368
00:16:43,350 --> 00:16:44,350
Everyone always says you're a pretty good guy.

369
00:16:44,350 --> 00:16:53,350
Your speech was a banger, too.

370
00:16:53,350 --> 00:16:57,350
It was like you'd forgotten to be not in the pastries, huh?

371
00:16:57,350 --> 00:17:00,350
It was like you'd felt pain, I'd have to be on the pastries.

372
00:17:00,350 --> 00:17:12,930
You really think that? Everyone always says you're a pretty good guy. Your speech was a banger, too. It was like you'd found yourself up there. Pretty cool. So who knows, man. You might be a good fit for her.

373
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:18,930
Well, then, what's going on with you and Hara? Shouldn't you ask her out already?

374
00:17:19,610 --> 00:17:21,310
I already did ask her.

375
00:17:22,030 --> 00:17:23,890
What? Is he talking about earlier?

376
00:17:23,890 --> 00:17:34,090
I mean, she just never takes me seriously. At the rate things are going, we're going to be stuck in this will-they-won't-they limbo until we just wind up as friends with benefits, you know?

377
00:17:35,450 --> 00:17:37,290
Though, guess that's fine, too.

378
00:17:37,770 --> 00:17:41,650
