386
00:18:14,810 --> 00:18:21,810
I mean...

387
00:18:21,810 --> 00:18:29,590
I mean, just because you spend a lot of time alone with someone you really like doesn't mean you don't want to keep doing it again and again.

388
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:30,430
What?

389
00:18:31,430 --> 00:18:33,990
Oh, no! I mean, Hara and Kanzuki!

390
00:18:34,110 --> 00:18:35,250
Uh, right, of course.

391
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:40,070
